---
id: Autentikasi-LupaPassword
title: Autentikasi - Lupa Password
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (Tidak Login)
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant C as AuthController
    participant U_Model as User Model
    participant Email as Email Service
    participant DB as Database

    U->>UI: Klik link "Lupa Password" pada halaman login
    UI->>UI: Tampilkan form dengan input email atau username
    U->>UI: Isi email/username dan klik "Kirim Kode Reset"
    UI->>C: POST /auth/forgot-password
    note over C: Validasi: email/username ada di sistem
    alt User ditemukan
        C->>U_Model: Find user atau generate reset token
        U_Model->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ? OR username = ?
        DB-->>U_Model: User data
        note over C: Generate unique reset token dengan expiry time (e.g., 24 jam)
        C->>Email: Send reset password email dengan link
        Email-->>U: Email diterima dengan link reset password
        C-->>UI: Response sukses
        UI-->>U: Notifikasi: "Email reset password sudah dikirim, cek email Anda"
    else User tidak ditemukan
        C-->>UI: Response success (fake, untuk security - tidak kasih tahu user ada/tidak)
        UI-->>U: Notifikasi: "Jika email terdaftar, link reset akan dikirim"
    end

